20518","id":4762180333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG9ka7Q","user":{"login":"abesmon","id":16459467,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDU5NDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16459467?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon","html_url":"https://github.com/abesmon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T13:48:30Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T13:53:02Z","body":"> Just as a heads up, this seems mostly generated by AI, so don't be suprised if this gets closed by a maintainer.\r\n> \r\n> See https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#ai-assisted-contributions and https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#contribute-only-what-you-understand for more info.\r\n\r\nI see! But, as you can see, i honestly mentioned, that it was AI assisted\r\n\r\nI think it would be a bit ridiculous to cancel this request because of \"AI,\" since we (Godot users) have been dealing with this issue since Godot 4+ (and maybe even earlier), and someone needs to fix it already, otherwise it's impossible to use bluetooth devices properly (on macos) and have full-fledged voice chats\r\n\r\nIf this request is cancelled because of \"AI,\" it would be ridiculous, because I'd just have to go and manually retype the same code :D. Yes, without AI, but the code would be literally the same (well, maybe I'll reorder a couple of lines). It's just a really needed fix\r\n\r\n---\r\nP.S. about \"[contribute-only-what-you-understand](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#contribute-only-what-you-understand)\"\r\n\r\nIn my PR message i described the source of the bug, because i spent 3 days finding whats causing the issue :D I believe i really understand what's the source of the problem :)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762180333/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762240742","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120518#issuecomment-4762240742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120518","id":4762240742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG9oG5g","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T14:12:36Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T14:12:36Z","body":"> In my PR message i described the source of the bug, because i spent 3 days finding whats causing the issue :D I believe i really understand what's the source of the problem :)\r\n\r\nThat's what what it asks for, also please disclose what you used AI for and what parts are not written by you if any","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762240742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762268636","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120518#issuecomment-4762268636","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120518","id":4762268636,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG9pz3A","user":{"login":"abesmon","id":16459467,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDU5NDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16459467?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon","html_url":"https://github.com/abesmon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"cre