.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T15:02:09Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T15:02:09Z","body":"What stopped you from writing the code from the start? Did you understand the code and the solution?\r\n\r\nBut unfortunately this very vague behavior means it's hard to trust you do understand and would write it so you did after not following the guidelines the first time, that's at least how I would see it, if you had been honest about this from the start that might have been different","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762366847/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":2,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762408977","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120518#issuecomment-4762408977","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120518","id":4762408977,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG9yYEQ","user":{"login":"abesmon","id":16459467,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDU5NDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16459467?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon","html_url":"https://github.com/abesmon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abesmon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T15:18:21Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T15:18:21Z","body":"> What stopped you from writing the code from the start?\r\n\r\nI use it as an autocomplete on steroids. I'll never ship the code, which i'm not sure of\r\n\r\n>  Did you understand the code and the solution?\r\n\r\nYes, of course, also i did reply to you code review, so you can tell that i really know what i'm doing\r\n\r\n> it's hard to trust you do understand\r\n\r\nyou can just check my github :) I made a lot of contributions in particular for native swift with usage of rather complex (MPSGraph and native windows swift builds) stuff long time before GPT and stuff\r\n\r\nI agree that AI usage with no understanding should be restricted, but i can feel, that it is unfair to decline this fix only because i have not wrote this code with my fingers, but i can fully explain how it works. It's just bureaucracy\r\n\r\nI'd even understand the resistance if it were some simple fix that I was taking away from newbies and hindering their learning. But it's not! This issue has been a problem for us since 4+, and no one (well, there were attempts in #88628) is doing anything about it. And report #106397 is already over a year old!\r\n\r\nI'm afraid that if the current fix isn't accepted, the problem will remain in the engine. The current refusal is simply some kind of sabotage to the development of the engine simply for the sake of strict compliance with the letter of the rules :( ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762408977/reactions","total_count":2,"